#: src/Privacy.php:347
msgid "When you buy a voucher, we store the recipient name, recipient email address, personal message and any personalisation you enter so that we can create and deliver the voucher. The recipient receives an email with the voucher if you entered their address. This data is kept as long as the voucher can be used and is then removed according to our retention settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:348
msgid "Vouchers, gift cards and store credit keep a history of every change of their balance (issue, payment in an order, refund, top-up, manual correction) with the date, the amount, the order number and, when a voucher is used by another customer, that customer's email address. Store credit is linked to your customer account. We keep this history as long as the voucher or credit can be used and as long as we are required to keep accounting records."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:349
msgid "Refer a friend: if you take part, we store your personal referral code, how many friends have ordered with it and which rewards you received. A friend's order that used your code is linked to your customer account so that we can give you the reward and take it back if the order is cancelled or refunded."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:350
msgid "When a voucher is redeemed outside the shop checkout, for example by a booking or ticket system on this website that is connected to our vouchers, we record the redemption with the connected service, the amount, the date, your customer account and the details that service passes on (for example its order or booking number)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:351
msgid "Tickets: when you exchange a ticket voucher for tickets or pay for tickets with a gift card, the voucher code, the amount, your name and email address and the attendee names you enter are passed to the ticket system on this website (WP Pass Captain), which issues and sends the tickets. Its privacy information applies to the tickets."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:352
msgid "At the entrance or the counter, our staff may scan the code of your voucher or ticket. We record the time, the staff member and the result (redeemed, checked in or refused) in the voucher history."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:353
msgid "To protect voucher codes against guessing, we count failed code entries per visitor for a short time window (at most 15 minutes). For this we store the counter under a hashed (pseudonymised) form of your IP address, never the address itself; the counters are deleted automatically after the window."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:356
msgid "License check (premium edition): to check the license and offer updates, this website sends its address (URL), the WordPress, PHP and plugin versions, the license key and a random installation ID to the license server of the plugin vendor when the license is activated, about twice a day and when updates are checked. No data about customers or orders is sent."
msgstr ""

